:"JS001","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Выполнение динамического кода","description":"eval() выполняет строку как код и часто превращает контролируемый пользователем ввод в удалённое выполнение кода.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\beval\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Замените eval() безопасным парсером или явным сопоставлением разрешённых операций.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS002","contentHash":"dc19c49c973397de731a68d86d3b2732b579ec7c0acfad3d893d132d1d778a8a","definition":{"id":"JS002","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Командная инъекция","description":"Запуск команды оболочки с динамически собранным аргументом может позволить выполнить произвольную системную команду.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:exec|execSync)\\s*\\(\\s*(?:`[^`]*\\$\\{|[^,]*(?:\\+|\\$\\{))","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Используйте execFile/spawn без shell, передавайте аргументы массивом и проверяйте их по allowlist.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS003","contentHash":"3b1d112f9c51804fd3b2a0d162c7e300936f2c21bc150988902c00ff2b518062","definition":{"id":"JS003","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Потенциальный DOM XSS","description":"Запись динамического HTML в DOM может исполнить внедрённый JavaScript.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:innerHTML|outerHTML)\\s*=|insertAdjacentHTML\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Используйте textContent или безопасные DOM API. Если HTML необходим — очищайте его проверенным sanitizer с allowlist.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS004","contentHash":"090115fa7a63166b9fc3482ef15215c0f351ec554bd79159785ee06894e8fb41","definition":{"id":"JS004","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Небезопасная десериализация","description":"Десериализация недоверенных данных библиотекой node-serialize может привести к выполнению кода.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A08:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:node-serialize|serialize-javascript).*|\\.unserialize\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Откажитесь от исполняемой десериализации. Используйте JSON и проверяйте данные по строгой схеме.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS005","contentHash":"7566bc5916f563c516ab4bdd779caa47c6f372b6de7ea8ac90770f5951367b6a","definition":{"id":"JS005","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Слабый генератор случайных значений","description":"Некриптографический генератор непригоден для токенов, идентификаторов сессий и других security-sensitive значений.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-338","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bMath\\.random\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Для секретных значений используйте crypto.randomBytes() или crypto.getRandomValues().","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/338.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY001","contentHash":"0d03a108fc60a86312a07288b63515b6c34f0ab80721e9e341377c1cf5ba9420","definition":{"id":"PY001","languages":["python"],"title":"Выполнение динамического кода","description":"eval/exec с недоверенным вводом может привести к выполнению произвольного Python-кода.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:eval|exec)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Используйте ast.literal_eval для литералов или явный разбор разрешённого формата.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY002","contentHash":"494f95ebb6904d87aedc025a15f0e4734a450874deeff8d7a13ad81268efd8fb","definition":{"id":"PY002","languages":["python"],"title":"Небезопасная десериализация YAML","description":"yaml.load без SafeLoader способен создавать произвольные Python-объекты.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A08:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"yaml\\.load\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":"SafeLoader|safe_load","excludeFlags":"","scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Используйте yaml.safe_load() и дополнительно проверяйте структуру результата.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY003","contentHash":"212ca96db12d4110933b6e6a2cfeb25b0289cf0ef7adac74e688afb727558a73","definition":{"id":"PY003","languages":["python"],"title":"Небезопасный запуск shell","description":"shell=True расширяет поверхность командной инъекции, особенно с динамическими аргументами.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:subprocess\\.|os\\.system\\s*\\().*shell\\s*=\\s*True|os\\.system\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Отключите shell, передавайте команду и аргументы массивом, валидируйте значения по allowlist.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY004","contentHash":"80a83819ff44cc921ce69da0cf78fd725f67319008f9b8c21c188d5f549eb926","definition":{"id":"PY004","languages":["python"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS","description":"verify=False отключает проверку сертификата и позволяет атакующему подменить защищённое соединение.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"verify\\s*=\\s*False","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Включите проверку сертификата и настройте доверенный CA bundle для частной инфраструктуры.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SQL001","contentHash":"e9fdff60cddd161cdf4bf5a4ba319eee9365aca2f8d1fc9ae557f55feca65a74","definition":{"id":"SQL001","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby"],"title":"Возможная SQL-инъекция","description":"SQL-запрос формируется конкатенацией или интерполяцией данных, что может изменить структуру запроса.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-89","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:SELECT|INSERT|UPDATE|DELETE)\\b.{0,120}(?:\\+\\s*[a-z_$]|\\$\\{|%s|\\.format\\s*\\(|f[\"''])","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Используйте параметризованный запрос или prepared statement. Не собирайте SQL строковой конкатенацией.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JAVA001","contentHash":"b7f9f153132837a0bc1a6851a95ed48e32bf4d0123ab70cc0490dc9f8c7c60ea","definition":{"id":"JAVA001","languages":["java"],"title":"Командная инъекция","description":"Runtime.exec или ProcessBuilder с динамическим аргументом может выполнить команды атакующего.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:Runtime\\.getRuntime\\(\\)\\.exec|new\\s+ProcessBuilder)\\s*\\([^)]*\\+","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Не вызывайте shell; передавайте фиксированную программу и отдельно валидированные аргументы.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PHP001","contentHash":"5ef212189d442287069da54e2bfd38fbe8d49cfd6c1991afba8216f4d247338a","definition":{"id":"PHP001","languages":["php"],"title":"Опасное выполнение команды","description":"Функция выполнения системных команд вызывается с потенциально динамическими данными.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:system|exec|shell_exec|passthru|popen)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Исключите системный вызов либо примените строгий allowlist и escapeshellarg для каждого аргумента.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PATH001","contentHash":"1a694fbf014f3dd334f5c6d030380d72611782a1fda9f2d647e3bbcc100edbbb","definition":{"id":"PATH001","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby"],"title":"Возможный path traversal","description":"Путь к файлу строится из данных запроса без видимой нормализации и проверки базовой директории.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-22","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:readFile|readFileSync|sendFile|open|FileInputStream|file_get_contents)\\s*\\([^)]*(?:\\breq\\.|\\brequest\\.|\\bparams\\b|\\bquery\\b|\\bargv\\b|\\$_?(?:GET|POST)\\b)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Нормализуйте путь, разрешайте только ожидаемые имена и проверяйте, что результат остаётся внутри фиксированной базовой директории.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/22.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CRYPTO001","contentHash":"6c5bd0d67a6877e1fd5acece0ab5942ac7498ab79377059ac5af798d85158bfa","definition":{"id":"CRYPTO001","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Слабый криптографический алгоритм","description":"MD5 или SHA-1 не следует использовать для паролей, подписей и других защитных механизмов.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-327","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:createHash\\s*\\(\\s*[\"''](?:md5|sha1)|hashlib\\.(?:md5|sha1)|MessageDigest\\.getInstance\\s*\\(\\s*[\"''](?:MD5|SHA-?1)|md5\\s*\\()","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Для паролей используйте Argon2id/scrypt/bcrypt, для целостности — SHA-256 или более современный алгоритм.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/327.html"]}},{"ruleId":"LOG001","contentHash":"80160df2211ab2ac3a11648deb019a24516599139d4eb56fedea7cbf9207708c","definition":{"id":"LOG001","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Чувствительные данные в журнале","description":"В журнал может попадать пароль, токен или иной секрет.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-532","owasp":"A09:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:console\\.log|logger\\.(?:info|debug|warn)|print\\s*\\().*(?:password|passwd|token|secret|authorization)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Не журналируйте секреты. Маскируйте чувствительные поля централизованным фильтром логгера.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/532.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CORS001","contentHash":"5971c46e229bc1a847c48ec090d80c5e3b3adb324c19d41406bc52d96dc472f5","definition":{"id":"CORS001","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Избыточно разрешающий CORS","description":"Wildcard origin разрешает читать ответы любому сайту и опасен для API с чувствительными данными.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-942","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:Access-Control-Allow-Origin[\"'']?\\s*[:,]\\s*[\"'']\\*|origin\\s*:\\s*[\"'']\\*)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Укажите точный allowlist доверенных origins и не сочетайте wildcard с credentialed-запросами.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/942.html"]}},{"ruleId":"DEBUG001","contentHash":"b00123c44762dddd7e6d52628943987d1b553cda3dfd5d53dffd798ccb9612a7","definition":{"id":"DEBUG001","languages":["python","php"],"title":"Режим отладки включён","description":"Production-сервер в debug-режиме может раскрыть конфигурацию, исходный код и интерактивную консоль.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-489","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:debug\\s*=\\s*True|display_errors\\s*[,=]\\s*(?:1|On|true))","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":null,"recommendation":"Отключите debug в production и управляйте режимом через проверенную конфигурацию окружения.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/489.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC003","contentHash":"7596792e7a4ff0f3f8bba464a7bc2432628d8401268f3e796e67b7771df931e9","definition":{"id":"SEC003","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Ключ доступа AWS","description":"В исходном коде найден идентификатор ключа AWS.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:AKIA|ASIA)[A-Z0-9]{16}\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Отзовите ключ в IAM, проверьте CloudTrail и храните новый ключ в secret manager.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC004","contentHash":"b961b3da3f719f5a2d173787315669b1e2e218bbdf09004e8c1b13949bc05336","definition":{"id":"SEC004","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Токен GitHub","description":"Найден токен доступа GitHub с узнаваемым префиксом.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:gh[opusr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{36,255}|github_pat_[A-Za-z0-9_]{40,255})\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Немедленно отзовите токен, проверьте журнал аудита и используйте GitHub Actions secrets.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC005","contentHash":"348efe5fb45520b9d438d5945235622bb3444502e03c14a92eff64af856783a4","definition":{"id":"SEC005","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Токен Slack","description":"Найден секрет Slack с узнаваемым форматом.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bxox[baprs]-[A-Za-z0-9-]{10,}\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Отзовите токен в Slack и перенесите секрет в защищённое хранилище.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC006","contentHash":"67daa60015f618d6172336da1200c3edd7a73b6fee492625faa8c299cb2f40c9","definition":{"id":"SEC006","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Приватный ключ или seed","description":"Найдено значение, похожее на приватный ключ, seed или mnemonic.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-321","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:PRIVATE[_-]?KEY|MNEMONIC|SEED[_-]?PHRASE)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"''][^\"'']{16,}[\"'']","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Считайте ключ скомпрометированным, перевыпустите его и исключите из истории Git.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/321.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC007","contentHash":"f84961d40ae827396385a6809f95e0f3bf6e6c1e9674cc7f3d78b1c03b2cdff1","definition":{"id":"SEC007","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Учётные данные в URL базы данных","description":"URI подключения содержит имя пользователя и пароль.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:postgres(?:ql)?|mysql|mongodb(?:\\+srv)?|redis):\\/\\/[^\\s:\"'']+:[^\\s@\"'']+@","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Передавайте URI через secret manager или переменную окружения и смените пароль.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC008","contentHash":"0106f394aebbe5b6369e2fc2217ee49b5a266f18dee2221dce7451b94377839f","definition":{"id":"SEC008","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Жёстко заданный Bearer-токен","description":"Заголовок авторизации содержит статический токен.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:Authorization|authorization)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'']Bearer\\s+[A-Za-z0-9._~+\\/-]{12,}[\"'']","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Отзовите токен и загружайте его из защищённой конфигурации.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC009","contentHash":"a962d5f7295fe49d8e4ab55c25ebaa3c9a0eb6d31eca827472a86a0da5bbf608","definition":{"id":"SEC009","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"JWT в исходном коде","description":"Найден сериализованный JWT, который может предоставлять доступ.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\beyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]{10,}\\.eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]{10,}\\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,}\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Удалите и отзовите токен; не храните сессионные артефакты в репозитории.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS006","contentHash":"ddf4a193b270b8062b45c833c171c20a0da08d6c21aba6ba7972b0197b862c5a","definition":{"id":"JS006","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Конструктор динамической функции","description":"new Function компилирует строку как JavaScript и допускает инъекцию кода.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bnew\\s+Function\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Замените динамическое выполнение явным диспетчером разрешённых операций.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS007","contentHash":"393120e039bf3e3177e538fcb633c5f5ca2e065ecdcd9004fb467aa8437490fd","definition":{"id":"JS007","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Выполнение кода через VM","description":"VM API выполняет динамически сформированный JavaScript.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bvm\\.(?:runInNewContext|runInContext|runInThisContext|compileFunction)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Не используйте VM как границу безопасности; изолируйте недоверенный код вне процесса.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS008","contentHash":"2b9eb2b085f9ce58dc87e8a3d416db80840eef2c8e3f4abffe146e721b6ba3eb","definition":{"id":"JS008","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"React XSS sink","description":"dangerouslySetInnerHTML может вставить в страницу непроверенный HTML.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\s*=|__html\\s*:","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Удалите HTML sink либо очищайте данные проверенным sanitizer с allowlist.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS009","contentHash":"c2dd125bc23b27918ce5dc639a143c1e73a17b62f3c365cbb2fec6817c743e44","definition":{"id":"JS009","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS","description":"rejectUnauthorized=false принимает недоверенные сертификаты.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"rejectUnauthorized\\s*:\\s*false","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Включите проверку сертификата и настройте доверенный CA.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS010","contentHash":"62c33bb88e48279d858b1833264173be0caf5ecfc6dd72ab0c65d85b745cbd85","definition":{"id":"JS010","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Небезопасная проверка JWT","description":"Проверка подписи JWT отключена или разрешён алгоритм none.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-347","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:algorithms?\\s*:\\s*\\[[^\\]]*[\"'']none[\"'']|ignoreExpiration\\s*:\\s*true|jwt\\.decode\\s*\\()","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Используйте jwt.verify, фиксированный allowlist алгоритмов, issuer и audience.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/347.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS011","contentHash":"086e9d4abbd38c0f9e324ad5ee1e3586b0ed86904b47a7c7b8a67fc40182d0d3","definition":{"id":"JS011","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"SSRF через сетевой запрос","description":"URL сетевого запроса берётся непосредственно из HTTP-запроса.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-918","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:fetch|axios\\.(?:get|post|request)|https?\\.(?:get|request))\\s*\\([^\\n)]*(?:req\\.|request\\.|params|query|body)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"ssrf","recommendation":"Разрешайте только известные схемы, хосты и порты; блокируйте private/link-local адреса.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/918.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS012","contentHash":"d80a2d3410b529381df24d25b2015df997efce1ae90323ac7d661b1f1cb2628a","definition":{"id":"JS012","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Небезопасный redirect","description":"Цель перенаправления контролируется параметрами запроса.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-601","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:res\\.|response\\.)redirect\\s*\\([^\\n)]*(?:req\\.|request\\.|params|query|body)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"validation","recommendation":"Используйте относительные пути или allowlist доверенных назначений.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/601.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS013","contentHash":"5a09e110494d33442902bed2f3c92a3d113a6b6624d560db9e0890ef7b5f3423","definition":{"id":"JS013","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Prototype pollution","description":"Контролируемый ключ записывается в объект и может изменить его прототип.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-1321","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\w+\\s*\\[\\s*(?:req\\.|request\\.|params|query|body)[^\\]]*\\]\\s*=","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Запрещайте __proto__, constructor и prototype; используйте Map или объекты без прототипа.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1321.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS014","contentHash":"b1a9edae95597385d7af7b3043f9934c65cbaa8c0a6ea5b030e7f17697553476","definition":{"id":"JS014","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Слабые параметры cookie","description":"Cookie явно разрешает передачу без HttpOnly, Secure или с SameSite=None без Secure.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-614","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:httpOnly\\s*:\\s*false|secure\\s*:\\s*false|sameSite\\s*:\\s*[\"'']none[\"''][\\s\\S]{0,100}secure\\s*:\\s*false)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"session","recommendation":"Для сессионных cookie включите HttpOnly, Secure и подходящий SameSite.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/614.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS015","contentHash":"54ffc5b192727f89edbee5f783255db9534ae18bf28da59d3389b74656d65813","definition":{"id":"JS015","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"NoSQL-инъекция","description":"Объект фильтра MongoDB строится непосредственно из данных запроса.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-943","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.(?:find|findOne|findOneAndUpdate|deleteMany|updateMany)\\s*\\(\\s*(?:req\\.(?:body|query)|request\\.)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Валидируйте схему и типы, удаляйте операторы с $ и собирайте фильтр из разрешённых полей.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/943.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY005","contentHash":"aeca8594e4df26543cd10ccb0f42884345acf5b6a842d75b2db2e328b4b623c7","definition":{"id":"PY005","languages":["python"],"title":"Небезопасная десериализация Pickle","description":"pickle может выполнить код при загрузке недоверенных данных.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:pickle|cPickle|dill)\\.loads?\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"deserialization","recommendation":"Используйте JSON со строгой схемой; никогда не загружайте pickle из недоверенного источника.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY006","contentHash":"f8e182ab29b0d73cea59e214d523669c64d1396be4b3badbc221bab1ec820854","definition":{"id":"PY006","languages":["python"],"title":"Шаблонная инъекция Flask/Jinja","description":"Строка шаблона формируется во время выполнения.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-1336","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\brender_template_string\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Используйте статические файлы шаблонов и передавайте данные только как параметры.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1336.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY007","contentHash":"47fda242969cdcb4a9f6290000f7ce5d5be9af3fe3e14cf2a89f3e1ab5dcd314","definition":{"id":"PY007","languages":["python"],"title":"Слабая генерация security-токена","description":"Модуль random не является криптографически стойким.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-338","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\brandom\\.(?:random|randint|randrange|choice|choices|getrandbits)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Для токенов и ключей используйте secrets или os.urandom.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/338.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY008","contentHash":"43c045727444bfd69eaa412a909954dc918ca73490a41603f655208632003cd0","definition":{"id":"PY008","languages":["python"],"title":"SSRF через requests","description":"URL запроса получен напрямую из web-параметра.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-918","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"requests\\.(?:get|post|put|delete|request)\\s*\\([^\\n)]*(?:request\\.|args\\.|form\\.|json)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"ssrf","recommendation":"Проверяйте схему, DNS/IP после резолвинга и allowlist назначений.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/918.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY009","contentHash":"75622b65d46eef135abc5b70f95feabee9e0e5f666a5164470af044dadbc1851","definition":{"id":"PY009","languages":["python"],"title":"Небезопасный XML-парсер","description":"Стандартный XML-парсер используется для потенциально недоверенных данных.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-611","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:xml\\.etree\\.ElementTree|xml\\.dom\\.minidom|xml\\.sax)\\.(?:parse|fromstring|parseString)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xxe","recommendation":"Используйте defusedxml и запретите DTD/внешние сущности.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/611.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY010","contentHash":"f2476487c213f8cc981f04c7bd1595e64b4303dfcc7042a525876a76941ee3c0","definition":{"id":"PY010","languages":["python"],"title":"Слабое хеширование пароля","description":"Пароль хешируется быстрым общим алгоритмом.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-916","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:md5|sha1|sha256)\\s*\\([^\\n]*(?:password|passwd)|hashlib\\.(?:md5|sha1|sha256)\\s*\\([^\\n]*(?:password|passwd)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Используйте Argon2id, scrypt или bcrypt с уникальной солью.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/916.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY011","contentHash":"d3bf3ae9b7148589e9f76a485e07e6bf316c6384aa1cf4a4b42a7699a8f84cc6","definition":{"id":"PY011","languages":["python"],"title":"Небезопасный временный файл","description":"tempfile.mktemp создаёт имя отдельно от открытия файла и допускает race condition.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-377","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\btempfile\\.mktemp\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"filesystem","recommendation":"Используйте NamedTemporaryFile или mkstemp и сохраняйте открытый файловый дескриптор.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/377.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY012","contentHash":"ffed8a3b0986d5920df732d789c5cb37c949dc2b8e2cb25987d96be26c62c8ea","definition":{"id":"PY012","languages":["python"],"title":"Небезопасная распаковка архива","description":"extractall может записать файл за пределами каталога назначения через traversal-путь.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-22","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:tarfile|zipfile)[^\\n]*\\.extractall\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"validation","recommendation":"Проверяйте каждый нормализованный путь участника архива и отклоняйте выход за каталог назначения.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/22.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY013","contentHash":"25c5b6ee22e02c86ce3e6d4fe6cf40d3c540db75b09dfbbda67ef7b40be71d5e","definition":{"id":"PY013","languages":["python"],"title":"Обход HTML-экранирования","description":"mark_safe или Markup помечает строку доверенным HTML.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:mark_safe|Markup)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Не помечайте пользовательские данные безопасными; используйте контекстное экранирование.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY014","contentHash":"e675b149975dfe6cd6878d415353cef0bc6e48eb3827ffcf56b2f0bdefc66e42","definition":{"id":"PY014","languages":["python"],"title":"JWT без проверки подписи","description":"Проверка подписи JWT явно отключена или разрешён алгоритм none.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-347","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"jwt\\.decode\\s*\\([^\\n]*(?:verify_signature[\"'']?\\s*:\\s*False|verify\\s*=\\s*False|algorithms\\s*=\\s*\\[[^\\]]*[\"'']none[\"''])","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Всегда проверяйте подпись, issuer, audience и используйте фиксированный allowlist алгоритмов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/347.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY015","contentHash":"050c4ee94d3eeac5d47be808caddac526732e7eb6e66af2ed93349e65a50dc46","definition":{"id":"PY015","languages":["python"],"title":"Слабая криптографическая хеш-функция","description":"MD5 или SHA-1 не обеспечивают стойкость к коллизиям.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-327","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bhashlib\\.(?:md5|sha1)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Используйте SHA-256/512 для целостности или Argon2id/scrypt/bcrypt для паролей.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/327.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY016","contentHash":"b135735e6d28019a25e3ba9493b99556b2aa850298dacdd3f2594b1cb35b3367","definition":{"id":"PY016","languages":["python"],"title":"Чувствительные данные в журнале","description":"В журнал может попасть пароль, токен или секрет.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-532","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:logging|logger)\\.(?:debug|info|warning|error|critical)\\s*\\([^\\n]*(?:password|passwd|token|secret)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"logging","recommendation":"Не журналируйте секреты; маскируйте чувствительные поля до передачи логгеру.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/532.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JAVA002","contentHash":"39cd4e26d04d0f7d0d48b218325aaa2ad3944efb22584f9267689522b79c1830","definition":{"id":"JAVA002","languages":["java","kotlin"],"title":"Небезопасная Java-десериализация","description":"ObjectInputStream может создать опасную цепочку объектов.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:(?:new\\s+)?ObjectInputStream\\s*\\(|\\.readObject\\s*\\()","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"deserialization","recommendation":"Откажитесь от native serialization или применяйте строгий JEP 290 allowlist.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JAVA003","contentHash":"bf95c27402ddc766fc9d74328df09abb134d8bb595