{"ruleId":"CS002","contentHash":"22362e1edd8c4fa45a4b9de4fe8f1bf2d93865078ab2c2894b40cf70069ca1a0","definition":{"id":"CS002","languages":["csharp"],"title":"Отключена проверка сертификата","description":"Callback безусловно принимает любой TLS-сертификат.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"ServerCertificateValidationCallback[\\s\\S]{0,160}(?:=>\\s*true|return\\s+true)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"transport","recommendation":"Удалите callback или выполняйте полноценную проверку цепочки и hostname.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CS003","contentHash":"e240d9359e834a099565087f1b3319c6a61f6053cd1754bb1768ad51be09f657","definition":{"id":"CS003","languages":["csharp"],"title":"Командная инъекция .NET","description":"Process.Start получает динамически собранную команду.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"Process\\.Start\\s*\\([^\\n)]*(?:\\+|\\$\")","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Фиксируйте FileName, используйте ArgumentList и allowlist значений.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RB001","contentHash":"896c0eff021c7ee1ce593aac1d60e9862393f53e6758441e92cc10c37570509c","definition":{"id":"RB001","languages":["ruby"],"title":"Небезопасная Ruby-десериализация","description":"Marshal.load или YAML.load может создавать произвольные объекты.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:Marshal\\.load|YAML\\.(?:load|unsafe_load))\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"deserialization","recommendation":"Используйте JSON или YAML.safe_load с разрешёнными классами.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RB002","contentHash":"76