igh","pattern":"\\bAccountKey\\s*=\\s*[A-Za-z0-9+/]{86}==","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Смените ключ Storage Account; используйте managed identity или хранилище секретов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS030","contentHash":"7451675c956e53f582335571677f34f08752b6f1f338bf4200e62761a885676b","definition":{"id":"JS030","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Динамический HTML через document.write","description":"document.write получает динамическое значение, которое может содержать HTML или скрипт.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bdocument\\.write(?:ln)?\\s*\\(\\s*(?:[A-Za-z_$]|`[^`\\n]*\\$\\{|[\"''][^\"''\\n]*[\"'']\\s*\\+)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Используйте textContent или безопасное построение DOM; очищайте необходимый HTML.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS031","contentHash":"6c0c5cef72c60965f93d6dbddf2af39c8e41d45493463b311da7812a05752f72","definition":{"id":"JS031","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Строковый код в таймере","description":"setTimeout/setInterval получает строку кода вместо функции.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bset(?:Timeout|Interval)\\s*\\(\\s*[\"''`]","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Передавайте callback-функцию, а данные — отдельными аргументами.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS032","contentHash":"21db54e67e19d069c9dc9594c5b9d6b3099fd4a3ae028b247a03085673f71cdc","definition":{"id":"JS032","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"postMessage без ограничения origin","description":"Сообщение может быть доставлено окну любого origin.",