806fca16d134f11107","definition":{"id":"CS030","languages":["csharp"],"title":"HttpClient принимает любой сертификат","description":"Использован DangerousAcceptAnyServerCertificateValidator.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bDangerousAcceptAnyServerCertificateValidator\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Восстановите системную проверку сертификата и настройте доверенный CA.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CS031","contentHash":"ffca28d2866a01c1423aa775664e4221edb17e3bdd4003aebbaddd928deaccd6","definition":{"id":"CS031","languages":["csharp"],"title":"SQL через интерполяцию в EF Core","description":"FromSqlRaw/ExecuteSqlRaw получает интерполированную строку или конкатенацию.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-89","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:FromSqlRaw|ExecuteSqlRaw)(?:Async)?\\s*\\(\\s*(?:\\$@?\"|@\\$\"|\"[^\"\\n]*\"\\s*\\+)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Используйте FromSqlInterpolated/ExecuteSqlInterpolated или bind-параметры raw API.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CS032","contentHash":"888d6f80a305b453c8cd4bf498112551be1daf2f6290bfa498a59949fe5cb88b","definition":{"id":"CS032","languages":["csharp"],"title":"LDAP-фильтр через конкатенацию .NET","description":"DirectorySearcher.Filter строится из конкатенации или интерполяции.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-90","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bFilter\\s*=\\s*(?:\\$\"\\([^\"\\n]*|\"\\([^\"\\n]*\"\\s*\\+)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Фиксируйте LDAP-фильтр и экранируйте специальные символы значения.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/90.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CS033","content