","definition":{"id":"CFG034","languages":["config"],"title":"Docker использует host PID","description":"Compose-контейнер получает PID namespace хоста.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-250","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"^\\s*pid\\s*:\\s*[\"'']?host[\"'']?\\s*(?:#.*)?$","patternFlags":"m","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Используйте отдельный PID namespace и ограничьте диагностику узла.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/250.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG035","contentHash":"3a382abce3053282d9d9efc6aa1a39c754bc71515eb6816e185839aaff41fb67","definition":{"id":"CFG035","languages":["config"],"title":"GitHub Actions выдаёт write-all","description":"Workflow предоставляет токену полный набор write permissions.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-732","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"^\\s*permissions\\s*:\\s*[\"'']?write-all[\"'']?\\s*(?:#.*)?$","patternFlags":"m","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authorization","recommendation":"Задайте минимальные permissions для каждого job, обычно contents: read.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/732.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG036","contentHash":"ae5b3e23bbfbccd6fd87cdc1192acd5ee161ca8ab0c331b35cf97c251fb7bdc0","definition":{"id":"CFG036","languages":["config"],"title":"GitHub Actions исполняет текст события","description":"run/script напрямую подставляет пользовательский title/body/head_ref события в скрипт.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:^\\s*(?:run|script)\\s*:[^\\n]*|^\\s*(?:echo|printf|bash|sh|node|python|curl|git)\\b[^\\n]*)\\$\\{\\{\\s*github\\.event\\.(?:issue\\.(?:title|body)|pull_request\\.(?:title|body|head\\.ref)|comment\\.body|head_commit\\.message)\\s*\\}\\}","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Передайте поле события через env и используйте переме