ическое выполнение кода статическими функциями.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/693.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG040","contentHash":"8286c70e73d50f99f1722d6ebf6e115f6c0c7b52f6c96982d9cca88e754ff31a","definition":{"id":"CFG040","languages":["config"],"title":"Android debug включён в manifest","description":"Android-приложение явно разрешает подключение отладчика.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-489","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bandroid:debuggable\\s*=\\s*[\"'']true[\"'']","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Отключите debuggable в release manifest и проверяйте параметры подписанного APK.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/489.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG041","contentHash":"3d1ebb87f46f9d41c740d59f49ec54273165da5c0045619c8652cb46994585c7","definition":{"id":"CFG041","languages":["config"],"title":"IAM разрешает все действия","description":"Allow-policy содержит Action ''*''; проверьте ограничения Resource и Condition.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-732","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\"Effect\"\\s*:\\s*\"Allow\"[^{}]{0,500}\"Action\"\\s*:\\s*(?:\"\\*\"|\\[\\s*\"\\*\"\\s*\\])|\"Action\"\\s*:\\s*(?:\"\\*\"|\\[\\s*\"\\*\"\\s*\\])[^{}]{0,500}\"Effect\"\\s*:\\s*\"Allow\"","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"authorization","recommendation":"Укажите минимальный список IAM actions, ресурсов и условий доступа.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/732.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG042","contentHash":"2a656340bf71de591bff83d625c1bd4d20db119f4e5e6b21884269923c029845","definition":{"id":"CFG042","languages":["config"],"title":"Публичный ACL хранилища","description":"ACL явно разрешает публичное чтение или запись объекта хранилища.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-284","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"[\"'']?\\bacl[\"'']?\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'']?(?:public-read-write|publ