75","description":"Опубликован Docker API port 2375. Найдена настройка, требующая проверки в production и ограничения предоставленных возможностей.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-306","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"[\"'']?(?:0\\.0\\.0\\.0:)?2375:2375(?:\\/tcp)?[\"'']?","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Не публикуйте plaintext Docker API; используйте Unix socket или защищённый TLS endpoint.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/306.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG108","contentHash":"a9416b2d84bc3dc2f4154a5b181c32901f25bf533209a8b94114a85924a989cd","definition":{"id":"CFG108","languages":["config"],"title":"Docker доверяет insecure registry","description":"Docker доверяет insecure registry. Настройка ослабляет защиту соединения. Проверьте протокол и аутентификацию другой стороны.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-319","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\"insecure-registries\"\\s*:\\s*\\[\\s*\"[^\"\\n]+\"","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Используйте HTTPS registry с доверенным сертификатом.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/319.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG109","contentHash":"99b67bb7a52ced68c3d34f21abda2d596b420d82ea112c22d59f246a9eb7e204","definition":{"id":"CFG109","languages":["config"],"title":"S3 отключает Public Access Block","description":"S3 отключает Public Access Block. Настройка может расширить доступ к данным или операциям. Проверьте требуемые permissions.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-284","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:BlockPublicAcls|IgnorePublicAcls|BlockPublicPolicy|RestrictPublicBuckets)[\"'']?\\s*:\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authorization","recommendation":"Включите Public Access Block; публичный доступ разрешайте только по утверждённой политике.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/284.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG110","contentHash":"9a9e5c74c234e90798a08063ef2d662bb24614232b9c289e94f8c25f4d9ecc1b","definition":{"id":"CFG110","languages":["config"],"title":"Cloud storage без encryption at rest","description":"Cloud storage без encryption at rest. Параметр или алгоритм требует проверки для использования в защитных механизмах.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-311","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bStorageEncrypted[\"'']?\\s*:\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Включите encryption at rest с защищённым KMS-ключом.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/311.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG111","contentHash":"8fc4f5eb7f552a57c43f43f96034d7532b7a78229474de5b8d62acbde40027d8","definition":{"id":"CFG111","languages":["config"],"title":"База данных публично доступна","description":"База данных публично доступна. Настройка может расширить доступ к данным или операциям. Проверьте требуемые permissions.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-284","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bPubliclyAccessible[\"'']?\\s*:\\s*true\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authorization","recommendation":"Закройте публичный доступ к БД и ограничьте сетевые источники.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/284.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG112","contentHash":"f3d0f67220b09d72dfdcc5188e09ad05eab2ce1f7f754e0d6c54b0316311839a","definition":{"id":"CFG112","languages":["config"],"title":"KMS key rotation отключён","description":"KMS key rotation отключён. Параметр или алгоритм требует проверки для использования в защитных механизмах.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-320","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bEnableKeyRotation[\"'']?\\s*:\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Включите поддерживаемую rotation policy и контролируйте жизненный цикл ключей.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/320.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG113","contentHash":"b03c467370287fd46815dd5237782ef3a048295d1fca94dbf6934eeedf3934d3","definition":{"id":"CFG113","languages":["config"],"title":"Database deletion protection отключён","description":"Database deletion protection отключён. Найдена настройка, требующая проверки в production и ограничения предоставленных возможностей.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-1188","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bDeletionProtection[\"'']?\\s*:\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Включите deletion protection для production-БД и ограничьте право удаления.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1188.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG114","contentHash":"b5e14c6ae9f10cd3607db86e888bae31e421830e0b1a366354cf0090fc8eca62","definition":{"id":"CFG114","languages":["config"],"title":"Redshift не требует SSL","description":"Redshift не требует SSL. Настройка ослабляет защиту соединения. Проверьте протокол и аутентификацию другой стороны.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-319","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\brequire_ssl[\"'']?\\s*[:=]\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Включите require_ssl и проверяйте сертификат при подключении.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/319.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG115","contentHash":"60cf2312620377e247ff93cf8e7e5c72a0689eb2475c5f850a88423508f96d09","definition":{"id":"CFG115","languages":["config"],"title":"Azure разрешает публичные blobs","description":"Azure разрешает публичные blobs. Настройка может расширить доступ к данным или операциям. Проверьте требуемые permissions.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-284","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\ballowBlobPublicAccess[\"'']?\\s*[:=]\\s*true\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authorization","recommendation":"Отключите public blob access и используйте ограниченные permissions/SAS.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/284.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG116","contentHash":"5328086d317107487052eddbb319fb757714fa1cb983ba11e7d13c6c69829989","definition":{"id":"CFG116","languages":["config"],"title":"Elasticsearch отключает security","description":"Elasticsearch отключает security. Настройка требует проверки защиты credentials, сессий или аутентификации.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-306","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bxpack\\.security\\.enabled\\s*[:=]\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Включите authentication/authorization Elasticsearch и TLS для сетевого доступа.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/306.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG117","contentHash":"618981b355b38e7cc7c62257bdcb1837471923160e577e0296dec06f8c27cc71","definition":{"id":"CFG117","languages":["config"],"title":"MongoDB отключает authorization","description":"MongoDB отключает authorization. Настройка требует проверки защиты credentials, сессий или аутентификации.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-306","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bauthorization\\s*:\\s*[\"'']?disabled\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Установите authorization: enabled и ограничьте роли пользователей.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/306.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG118","contentHash":"93c69873d32cbc65c609e33cd5f6d376b3b0fbd5e8d014c886e8378bef58bc60","definition":{"id":"CFG118","languages":["config"],"title":"Redis отключает protected mode","description":"Redis отключает protected mode. Настройка требует проверки защиты credentials, сессий или аутентификации.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-306","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"^\\s*protected-mode\\s*(?:[:=]\\s*)?no\\b","patternFlags":"im","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Включите protected-mode и настройте ACL, bind и TLS.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/306.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG119","contentHash":"8c05c6ddf1817b25d0ae07ca836b99905c0cf54df41fea26b6b1777a44448480","definition":{"id":"CFG119","languages":["config"],"title":"MySQL запускается без grants","description":"MySQL запускается без grants. Настройка требует проверки защиты credentials, сессий или аутентификации.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-306","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"^\\s*(?:--)?skip-grant-tables(?:\\s|=|$)","patternFlags":"im","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Удалите skip-grant-tables из production-конфигурации.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/306.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG120","contentHash":"80eebe52a536e1a706d5a7fd99b88f844320307c68de563d0456bfeec25d1680","definition":{"id":"CFG120","languages":["config"],"title":"Nginx не проверяет upstream TLS","description":"Nginx не проверяет upstream TLS. Настройка ослабляет защиту соединения. Проверьте протокол и аутентификацию другой стороны.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bproxy_ssl_verify\\s+off\\s*;","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Включите proxy_ssl_verify и настройте trusted CA/hostname upstream.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG121","contentHash":"77b306359958f705c72a5a21db49b09c08ac29181135950ee8ff023666263bad","definition":{"id":"CFG121","languages":["config"],"title":"HAProxy не проверяет backend TLS","description":"HAProxy не проверяет backend TLS. Настройка ослабляет защиту соединения. Проверьте протокол и аутентификацию другой стороны.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"^\\s*server\\s+[^\\n]*\\bssl\\b[^\\n]*\\bverify\\s+none\\b","patternFlags":"im","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Используйте verify required и доверенный CA для backend TLS.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG122","contentHash":"ae3cbc182335de757d4404959e4d297a03533a90809277ae7c7f1b2af43e75d2","definition":{"id":"CFG122","languages":["config"],"title":"Nginx публикует directory listing","description":"Nginx публикует directory listing. Найдена настройка, требующая проверки в production и ограничения предоставленных возможностей.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-548","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bautoindex\\s+on\\s*;","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Отключите autoindex для непубличных каталогов и исключите секретные файлы.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/548.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG123","contentHash":"065e144d7c75971eae622d675914476455a9adebc76d4a82b081505333fc4ebf","definition":{"id":"CFG123","languages":["config"],"title":"Spring Actuator публикует все endpoints","description":"Spring Actuator публикует все endpoints. Найдена настройка, требующая проверки в production и ограничения предоставленных возможностей.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-200","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bmanagement\\.endpoints\\.web\\.exposure\\.include\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'']?\\*[\"'']?","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Публикуйте только необходимые Actuator endpoints с аутентификацией.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/200.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS200","contentHash":"23d4ab6d4d4c3b766865607b86cf5fc83c3bb0aad7c59c37e7cb4e826d8cd16f","definition":{"id":"JS200","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Angular доверяет ресурсному URL","description":"Angular доверяет ресурсному URL. Недоверенные данные определяют выполняемый код, запрос или имя операции. Проверьте источник данных и условия применения.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-829","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.bypassSecurityTrustResourceUrl\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Безопасная альтернатива: sanitizer.sanitize(SecurityContext.RESOURCE_URL, allowedUrl); Используйте фиксированную операцию и параметры; выбирайте команды, классы и модули из разрешённого списка.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/829.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS201","contentHash":"a29f1e7bfd839c3e5675d42073ef19d2eb5a1b1b1f2793e4e705408f5611c4f4","definition":{"id":"JS201","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Angular доверяет скрипту","description":"Angular доверяет скрипту. Недоверенные данные определяют выполняемый код, запрос или имя операции. Проверьте источник данных и условия применения.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.bypassSecurityTrustScript\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Безопасная альтернатива: runAllowedAction(action); Используйте фиксированную операцию и параметры; выбирайте команды, классы и модули из разрешённого списка.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS202","contentHash":"f62bc14538fd8acbbeb4d7838213252ce87b73d5a5cbdb3e72560a2f0b92eff3","definition":{"id":"JS202","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Angular доверяет стилям","description":"Angular доверяет стилям. Недоверенные данные могут попасть в исполняемый HTML, JavaScript или CSS. Проверьте источник данных и условия применения.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.bypassSecurityTrustStyle\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Безопасная альтернатива: sanitizer.sanitize(SecurityContext.STYLE, style); Сохраните экранирование по контексту; необходимый HTML очищайте по списку разрешённых элементов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS203","contentHash":"450fbe1bb0c3dd3ae9f8347679515f3f4e69c117157aab2ca6185a1fc138a14c","definition":{"id":"JS203","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"DOMParser разбирает HTTP HTML","description":"DOMParser разбирает HTTP HTML. Недоверенные данные могут попасть в исполняемый HTML, JavaScript или CSS. Проверьте источник данных и условия применения.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.parseFromString\\s*\\(\\s*(?:req|request)\\.(?:body|query|params)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Безопасная альтернатива: parser.parseFromString(sanitizedHtml, ''text/html''); Сохраните экранирование по контексту; необходимый HTML очищайте по списку разрешённых элементов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS204","contentHash":"0be790a2791728cf91b8f67ea289d3d8c9ed6f1249429b92bb719093a0d9c77c","definition":{"id":"JS204","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"jQuery append с HTTP HTML","description":"jQuery append с HTTP HTML. Недоверенные данные могут попасть в исполняемый HTML, JavaScript или CSS. Проверьте источник данных и условия применения.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.append\\s*\\(\\s*(?:req|request)\\.(?:body|query|params)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Безопасная альтернатива: element.append(document.createTextNode(text)); Сохраните экранирование по контексту; необходимый HTML очищайте по списку разрешённых элементов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS205","contentHash":"ac5f3314d9e96c07df61e2169cbe440c970dcc9fc17ea6b4059f38ba2748d759","definition":{"id":"JS205","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"jQuery prepend с HTTP HTML","description":"jQuery prepend с HTTP HTML. Недоверенные данные могут попасть в исполняемый HTML, JavaScript или CSS. Проверьте источник данных и условия применения.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.prepend\\s*\\(\\s*(?:req|request)\\.(?:body|query|params)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Безопасная альтернатива: element.prepend(document.createTextNode(text)); Сохраните экранирование по контексту; необходимый HTML очищайте по списку разрешённых элементов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS206","contentHash":"0c2164e210653a1c9ee4a47d4ff17bc98747dcf34a3bd6f5078eccf1fb8b3785","definition":{"id":"JS206","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"jQuery replaceWith с HTTP HTML","description":"jQuery replaceWith с HTTP HTML. Недоверенные данные могут попасть в исполняемый HTML, JavaScript или CSS. Проверьте источник данных и условия применения.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.replaceWith\\s*\\(\\s*(?:req|request)\\.(?:body|query|params)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Безопасная альтернатива: element.replaceWith(document.createTextNode(text)); Сохраните экранирование по контексту; необходимый HTML очищайте по списку разрешённых элементов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"rule